\subsection{Central Cylinder}

In the center of the radial TEC array lies a cylindrical region that represents the area not covered by the TEC elements. This central cylinder is defined by its radius $r_{\text{cyl}}$. This cylinder spans all 3 layers of the system, from the chip layer to the radial TEC array layer.

