\subsection{TEC Element}

TEC elements are sandwiched between radial insulators from both radial direction and azimuthal direction. Each TEC element is defined by its inner and outer radius, $r_{\text{in}}$ and $r_{\text{out}}$ respectively, as well as its thickness $t_{\text{TEC}}$.

